msgid ""
"this module's baud rate usually must be changed from its default of 9600 to "
"57600 for use with ArduPilot. This is usually accomplished connecting it to "
"a FTDI USB-serial adapter and using AT commands in a terminal program like "
"Putty. See the last section of this page for more information on setting up "
"the HC-06."
msgstr ""
"配合 ArduPilot 使用时，此模块的波特率通常必须从默认的 9600 改为 57600。一般做法是将其连接到 FTDI USB 转串口适配器，并在"
" Putty 等终端程序中使用 AT 命令。有关设置 HC-06 的更多信息，请参阅本页最后一节。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-mission-planner-bluetooth-connectivity.rst:20
#: 19091ac62c274bc79b49bfaa6ca894b9 23550890ebc1421c918645f5231adb56
