#: d683a4af5749471482706b51bf8541f9
msgid ""
"The Bluetooth data link often comes with both a DF13 6 pin and 6-to-5 pin "
"connector which make it easy to connect to the autopilot's serial ports. "
"Note that any unused serial port on the autopilot can be used."
msgstr "蓝牙数传链路通常同时附带 DF13 6 针和 6 转 5 针连接器，便于连接到飞控的串口。注意，飞控上任何未使用的串口都可以使用。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-mission-planner-bluetooth-connectivity.rst:27
#: 4fe317baca3642a8b81e0817ccb80c7f 8e8d115fd6c64aebad9e47bae7fef5a0
