#: cf97d6b183d945ad9c553b220d255211
msgid ""
"Once you have connected the Bluetooth data link you can power up the "
"autopilot.  It is OK to use USB connected power while using the Bluetooth "
"module connected to the autopilot as long the the total power of ALL "
"autopilot connected peripherals do not exceed the computer's capability "
"(usually 1A)"
msgstr ""
"连接好蓝牙数传后即可给飞控上电。在蓝牙模块接在飞控上的同时使用 USB 供电是可以的，只要飞控所连全部外设的总功率不超过计算机的供电能力（通常为 1A）"

#: ../../source/docs/common-mission-planner-bluetooth-connectivity.rst:39
