#: ../../source/docs/common-mission-planner-bluetooth-connectivity.rst:116
#: 7b95f11aa5894c4791782667a35d4fdf ad8d5941ce314554ae38b9798b76aab6
#: bddb5961429a490da1991ed8b880d717 c498acccedbd4cef9e47af022551ec6c
#: c6de9dcf2f024a03b905563a0839543b
msgid ""
"Your Bluetooth device should now be ready and you can connect to the port "
"presented by the BT adapter in Mission Planner at the baud rate of 57600 "
"(red LED steady on and not flashing)"
msgstr ""
"现在蓝牙设备应已就绪，你可以在 Mission Planner 中以 57600 波特率连接 BT 适配器提供的端口（红色 LED 常亮而非闪烁）"

#: ../../source/docs/common-mission-planner-bluetooth-connectivity.rst:122
#: 528224924ee9436a94f1048f232f942e 6dd522cdc5874f99ac2a2479117b92c3
#: 752a0e17691d4e76945dc8611835ddae 9214e0e7d46b402ab0a64ca7b8f18557
#: b309c9c356734e0e9727b004f47e7fda
msgid ""
"These instructions will show you how to connect to your vehicle from Android"
" device with a GCS app (like QGC, etc.) using the Bluetooth module."
msgstr "以下说明介绍如何使用蓝牙模块，通过 Android 设备上的 GCS 应用（如 QGC 等）连接到你的飞行器。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-mission-planner-bluetooth-connectivity.rst:126
#: 23b386840d244c07820c2b9726e47df9 49fe80b2a138412badfed0150ca5e6da
#: 84549e827185443b9eddbbae12f681d5 b46a9b974f6643c4bf49364607a0fecd
#: ea5d84920c1941d689b6c0c09d21ce4e
msgid ""
"Open the Android device's settings panel and turn Bluetooth connectivity ON "
"(usually by sliding a slider to the right).  In the same settings screen "
"click on \"Bluetooth\" which should cause a list of AVAILABLE DEVICES to "
"appear"
msgstr ""
"打开 Android 设备的设置面板并开启蓝牙（通常是向右滑动开关）。在同一设置界面点击“Bluetooth”，应会出现可用设备（AVAILABLE "
"DEVICES）列表"

#: ../../source/docs/common-mission-planner-bluetooth-connectivity.rst:131
#: 2a59af287c964887bf640c7254f5c26b 3a677ebbdfd448529f00567f1ec07d12
#: 7052f99ef00f4ef5be4612ba1cd72db3 c199de6252d242309c6fb90f43556a95
#: e7f0f323518346ce8547e06e65576129
msgid ""
"Power the vehicle and the \"HC-06\" (or whatever name you have changed it to"
" below) device should appear.  Click on it and enter \"1234\" or \"0000\" as"
" the PIN to pair with the device, then select OK."
msgstr ""
"给飞行器上电，“HC-06”（或你按下文改成的其他名称）设备应会出现。点击它并输入“1234”或“0000”作为 PIN 码与设备配对，然后选择 OK。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-mission-planner-bluetooth-connectivity.rst:136
#: 0e8bb921f6054d03a6a7052c17c48f6a 1509ae14bdc942fcb26dc55e1952f8a6
#: 1f5822cabf2043c79f0faed9bdd990f8 329597e729614ca2ad16568995a3236a
#: e57d0b1da8ac4f65a4fa5c6f7f6f0bf2
msgid ""
"Then start you Android based ground control station and connect the "
"Bluetooth data stream. Some systems will automatically ask you select the "
"GCS application to use the BT connection. Sometimes you will have to "
"explicitly setup the BT connection within the GCS application."
msgstr ""
"然后启动基于 Android 的地面站并连接蓝牙数据流。有些系统会自动询问你选择使用该 BT 连接的 GCS 应用。有时你需要在 GCS 应用内显式设置"
" BT 连接。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-mission-planner-bluetooth-connectivity.rst:141
#: 646094f56038438a8088b26c9ef9ffe4 88a6395d3cd1493280e1a428304a6693
