#: f84e6465dec64ef39e204cebba5ff83e
msgid ""
"You will need a FTDI to USB cable to change any of the configurations of the"
" device (not supplied). Often the baud rate must be changed from 9600 to "
"57600."
msgstr "要更改设备的任何配置，你需要一根 FTDI 转 USB 线（不随附）。通常需要把波特率从 9600 改为 57600。"

